6. Define rollout posture per FR: every agent FR begins in shadow mode and only progresses per the agent rollout runbook gates.
7. Define acceptance gates: golden-task set ID, replay-set ID, adversarial-set ID, pass thresholds, CI gate rule.
8. Write AI_Agent_Feature_PRD_Spec.md sections: 1) Agent FR Inventory, 2) Per-FR Agent Clauses, 3) Success Metrics, 4) Human-in-the-Loop Placement, 5) Rollout Posture, 6) Eval & Red-Team Acceptance Gates, 7) Traceability.

Validation: Halt if any agent FR lacks budget caps. Halt if any FR references a tool not enumerated in the action catalogue. Halt if any L1+ FR lacks a named approver role. Halt if any L2+ FR lacks a kill-switch reference. Halt if any agent FR has no replay-based eval acceptance gate.
